### Authentication & Role Guards

Protected endpoints require a valid JWT in the `Authorization` header:

```http
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
```

| Guard / Decorator | Behavior | Error Status & Message |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `@Public()` | Open to everyone without a token. Returns public fields only. | — |
| `JwtAuthGuard` | Verifies the `Bearer` token and checks that the user exists and `isActive === true`. | `401 Unauthorized` — `{ "message": "Authentication required. Please sign in." }` |
| `RolesGuard` (`@Roles('COORDINATOR')` or `@Roles('DONOR')`) | Verifies that `req.user.role` matches the required role. | `403 Forbidden` — `{ "message": "You do not have permission to perform this action." }` |

