## 20. Changing the Contract

When an endpoint, DTO field, or response shape needs to change:

1. Ask the team lead (Eyad Ibrahim) first.
2. Update the backend implementation and Swagger decorators.
3. Update this `docs/API.md`.
4. Update `client/src/services/` and `client/src/types/`.
5. Update `docs/PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` if any type or method signature changed.
6. Notify the affected frontend/backend pair in the team chat.

Never change a response shape, a field name, or an error message silently.
